{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/546174-size-and-health","id":546174,"title":"Size and Health","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-08T17:53:57-07:00","id":546174,"title":"Size and Health","content":"I've been reading into the Demon book over the last while, and I seem to be running myself in circles as far as health goes. Does a Demons health remain consistent across all of their forms, that is, if you have your regular size five demon and he takes the cover of someone with the small framed merit, does his health change? It's stated that attributes and the like remain consistent across all forms, but I find it slightly odd that I could build a character, Take the Giant Merit for his demon form, add the Huge Size Mod, take the extra 5 points of health and still appear to be a regularly sized human on my day to day business. This can't be right, can it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6351-kaoleth","name":"Kaoleth","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T08:28:11-07:00","id":547096,"title":"","content":"Your Health is dependant on your current Size. If you are bigger in one form than another, then you have higher Health.<br /> (There's a bit in the Demon book that talks about Size-altering merits as they relate to Covers, too.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2449-one-tin-soldier","name":"One Tin Soldier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2449_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T08:28:59-07:00","id":547098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demon: the Descent, p. 118</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">In rare cases, the character\u2019s Size might change; and if it does, any derived Traits associated with Size also change.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, no. You get the +1 for Giant when you're in a Cover that has that Merit, and you get the +4 for Huge Size when your demonic form power is active. The sidebar for simplified Cover Traits suggests applying Merits flatly across all forms, but that's an optional alternative for if you can't keep track of tying Merits to specific Covers. It also is still just for Merits, not demonic form abilities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T17:59:41-07:00","id":547803,"title":"","content":"And yes, that can quite obviously put your character into a bad spot if you've taken a lot of damage in a situation where you've got lots of additional health (e.g. that +4 from Huge Size) and then slink back into the cover and lose the additional health boxes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}